WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.506
Spots, and an eleven-year beat.

00:03.206 --> 00:05.833
Dark spots come and go on this surface.

00:06.283 --> 00:13.598
Each is a place where the Sun's magnetism is strong enough to hold back the heat, and many are larger than the Earth.

00:14.048 --> 00:19.905
Their number rises and falls about every eleven years, and so do the Sun's outbursts.
